information_signals.text:
@Ostrov_A @LewisHamilton Israel controls the Gazan side of the Rafah border.

Egypt's restrictions are mainly driven by concerns about permanent displacement of Palestinians.

If the Rafah crossing was open to Palestinians why should any other country be forced to house Gazan refugees Israel has created.

